# API Documentation

Base URL (local): `http://localhost:5050/api`
Base URL (production): `https://lms-backend-n8nu.onrender.com/api`

## Conventions

- All request/response bodies are JSON.
- Every response has a `success` boolean. Errors also include a `message`
  string, and sometimes a Mongoose `error` string with more detail.
- **Auth:** protected routes require an `Authorization: Bearer <token>`
  header. The token is returned by `POST /auth/register` and `POST /auth/login`.
- **Roles:** `student`, `instructor`, `admin`. Routes marked with a role
  require the logged-in user to have that role (`403 Forbidden` otherwise).
- Timestamps (`createdAt`, `updatedAt`) are included on every resource but
  omitted below for brevity.

