## Users

### `GET /users/me`
**Auth:** any logged-in user
Returns the current user's own profile (no password field).

### `PUT /users/me`
**Auth:** any logged-in user
**Body:** any of `{ "name", "bio", "avatar" }`

### `PUT /users/me/password`
**Auth:** any logged-in user
**Body:** `{ "currentPassword": "...", "newPassword": "..." }`

### `GET /users`
**Auth:** admin
All users on the platform.

### `PUT /users/:id`
**Auth:** admin
**Body:** any of `{ "role", "isActive" }` — used to promote/demote a user or
activate/deactivate their account.

### `DELETE /users/:id`
**Auth:** admin
Permanently deletes a user. **Blocked (`409`)** if the user is an instructor
with existing courses, or a student with existing enrollments — deactivate
(`PUT /users/:id` with `isActive: false`) instead, to avoid leaving courses
or enrollments pointing at a deleted account. If they have a review, it's
deleted along with them.

