## Courses

### `GET /courses`
**Auth:** none
**Query params:** `search` (matches title/category), `category`, `level`,
`featured` (`true`/`false`), `page`, `limit`
Only returns published courses.

### `GET /courses/my-courses`
**Auth:** instructor or admin
The logged-in instructor's own courses — published and draft.

### `GET /courses/all`
**Auth:** admin
Every course on the platform, any owner, any publish status.

### `GET /courses/:id`
**Auth:** optional (guests see published courses only; the owning
instructor/admin can also view their own draft)

### `POST /courses`
**Auth:** instructor or admin
**Body:** `{ "title", "description", "category", "level", "thumbnail", "isFeatured" }`
New courses start as an unpublished draft (`isPublished: false`).

### `PUT /courses/:id`
**Auth:** instructor (owner only) or admin
Same body shape as create; also accepts `isPublished` to publish/unpublish.

### `DELETE /courses/:id`
**Auth:** instructor (owner only) or admin

