## Lessons

### `GET /lessons/course/:courseId`
**Auth:** optional
Guests and non-enrolled students get a locked list (titles only, except any
lesson marked `isFreePreview`). Enrolled students, the owning instructor, and
admins get full lesson content.

### `GET /lessons/:id`
**Auth:** optional
Same gating logic as above, for a single lesson.

### `POST /lessons/course/:courseId`
**Auth:** instructor (owner of that course) or admin
**Body:** `{ "title", "description", "videoUrl", "duration", "order", "isFreePreview" }`
`title`, `videoUrl` and `order` are required — the frontend's lesson
manager computes `order` as "append to the end of the existing list".

### `PUT /lessons/:id`
**Auth:** instructor (owner) or admin

### `DELETE /lessons/:id`
**Auth:** instructor (owner) or admin
Every enrolled student's progress is automatically recalculated against the
course's new lesson count the next time their enrollment is read.

