## Categories

### `GET /categories`
**Auth:** none
Active categories only, each with a live `courseCount` (published courses
using that category name).

### `GET /categories/all`
**Auth:** admin
Every category, including hidden ones.

### `POST /categories`
**Auth:** admin
**Body:** `{ "name", "icon", "color", "isActive", "order" }`
`icon` is a string name from a curated lucide-react icon set (see
`frontend/src/lib/categoryIcons.js`) — the admin panel provides a visual
picker so nothing needs to be typed by hand.

### `PUT /categories/:id`
**Auth:** admin
Renaming a category cascades: every existing course using the old name is
updated to the new one, so nothing gets orphaned.

### `DELETE /categories/:id`
**Auth:** admin
Existing courses keep their category text either way — they just won't be
grouped under this category on the homepage/filters anymore.

