## Reviews

### `GET /reviews`
**Auth:** none
Visible reviews only, newest first (max 60) — powers the homepage/reviews
marquee.

### `GET /reviews/all`
**Auth:** admin
Every review, including hidden ones.

### `GET /reviews/mine`
**Auth:** any logged-in user
The current user's own review, or `null`.

### `POST /reviews`
**Auth:** any logged-in user
**Body:** `{ "role", "quote", "rating" }` (`rating` is 1–5)
One review per account (`409` if you already have one — use `PUT` instead).
Students need at least one enrollment and instructors need at least one
course before they're allowed to post (`403` with a clear message otherwise)
— admins skip this check.

### `PUT /reviews/:id`
**Auth:** the review's own author

### `DELETE /reviews/:id`
**Auth:** the review's own author, or admin

### `PATCH /reviews/:id/visibility`
**Auth:** admin
Toggles a review's `isVisible` flag — hides it from the public marquee
without deleting it.

