## Uploads

Both endpoints accept `multipart/form-data` and return `{ "success": true, "url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/..." }`. Files are streamed straight to Cloudinary — never written to the server's disk.

### `POST /upload/image`
**Auth:** instructor or admin
**Form field:** `image` — max 5MB, image files only.

### `POST /upload/video`
**Auth:** instructor or admin
**Form field:** `video` — max 100MB, video files only. The response also
includes `duration` (seconds, read directly from the uploaded file by
Cloudinary) so the lesson form can auto-fill it.

