## Error responses

Every error follows the same shape:
```json
{ "success": false, "message": "Human-readable explanation" }
```

Common status codes:

| Code | Meaning |
|---|---|
| 400 | Missing/invalid input |
| 401 | Missing or invalid auth token |
| 403 | Logged in, but not allowed to do this (wrong role, not the owner, not eligible yet) |
| 404 | Resource not found |
| 409 | Conflict (already enrolled, already reviewed, duplicate category name, etc.) |
| 413 | Uploaded file too large |
| 500 | Unexpected server error |
